<p>Two sailboats carrying humanitarian aid to Cuba have safely reached the island after concerns about their whereabouts prompted search efforts and public appeals. The vessels were part of an aid convoy traveling from Isla Mujeres, Mexico, to Cuba with nine people on board. On Friday, U.S. Coast Guard officials said the boats had &quot;safely transited&quot; to Cuba. Before that confirmation, Mexico&#x27;s navy launched a search-and-rescue mission after losing communication with the boats, while Cuban President Miguel Díaz-Canel said authorities would do everything possible to help find those aboard. The episode drew attention because the convoy was delivering humanitarian supplies to Cuba as the island faces food and fuel shortages described in the coverage.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/9cut4cyObM_6Hf1OvLVQhaWFTlnZjlwdKi0T28kHsaLsgo04wfB9QHCozTsXi5t7SlFA_cYhHW-0pX-h6H8qLruFmvKdv6M5y25BnBvjjESqg5oNROvX7lYPHDxNqYupslyja4WKcOWpA5zS63EejPirszZUeC2LAKPilpzr3X1Xh3dm_RJtWx3FXn07cBOcGFCdgmhlJS9XwfTXrSgvOxrAalIaGe4mjfVdRjhAU3JKISL0IQzKh9ZywWLNN6tzyUAeeG5edgc642ktbCbF' alt='Aid convoy sailboats involved in the Mexico-to-Cuba voyage.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Search response: Mexico&#x27;s navy said it sent a plane, a helicopter, two boats, and personnel on jet skis after contact with the vessels was lost.</li><li>Organizers&#x27; view: The Nuestra America Convoy said experienced sailors were leading the boats and that they carried safety equipment, including satellite systems and radio communication devices.</li><li>Aid mission: The flotilla was carrying humanitarian supplies for Cuba, including powdered milk, medicines, and medical items.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Cuban government: President Miguel Díaz-Canel publicly expressed concern and said Cuba was ready to do everything within its reach to help those on board, signaling official backing for the rescue effort. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/cubas-president-expresses-concern-2-missing-aid-sailboats-131471602'>ABC News</a>)</li><li>Mexico&#x27;s navy: Mexican naval authorities treated the loss of contact as a search-and-rescue case and deployed air, sea, and near-shore assets to find the vessels. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cp84kw1y337o'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Nuestra America Convoy: The aid convoy&#x27;s organizers said experienced sailors were handling the voyage and that the boats had onboard safety gear, suggesting they believed the mission was responsibly prepared. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/27/mexicos-navy-searches-for-two-missing-boats-involved-in-cuba-aid-convoy'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>U.S. Coast Guard: The U.S. Coast Guard said the boats had safely transited to Cuba and noted that it was not directly involved in the search effort. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3348215/missing-aid-boats-safely-crossed-cuba-us-coastguard-says'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/cubas-president-expresses-concern-2-missing-aid-sailboats-131471602'>Cuba&#x27;s president expresses concern over 2 missing aid sailboats headed to island</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3348215/missing-aid-boats-safely-crossed-cuba-us-coastguard-says'>Missing aid boats safely crossed to Cuba, US coastguard says</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/27/mexicos-navy-searches-for-two-missing-boats-involved-in-cuba-aid-convoy'>Mexico’s navy searches for two missing boats involved in Cuba aid convoy</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/missing-sailboats-for-cuba-aid-convoy-arrived-safely-afp-reports'>Sailboats carrying aid from Mexico to Cuba still missing</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cp84kw1y337o'>Two Cuba-bound aid ships missing after leaving Mexico</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/27/cuba-aid-boats-missing-en-route-mexico-our-america-convoy'>Missing aid boats have safely reached Cuba, US confirms</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>